<p>Give formulas for the following tangent lines at <m>x=2</m>.</p>
<p><alert> (A) </alert> The tangent line to <m>y=f{\small(x)}</m> at <m>x=2</m>.</p>
<p><m>\quad y =</m><fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><alert> (B) </alert> The tangent line to <m>y=f{\small(x)} + x</m> at <m>x=2</m>.</p>
<p><m>\quad y =</m><fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p><alert> (C) </alert> The tangent line to <m>y= x  f{\small(x)}</m> at <m>x=2</m>.</p>
<p><m>\quad y =</m><fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
<p><alert> (D) </alert> The tangent line to <m>y= f{\small(x+1)}</m> at <m>x=2</m>.</p>
<p><m>\quad y =</m><fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0004"/></p>
</statement>
